#
# File: 910-mDNS-udp-dport5353-out-req-DROP.rule
# Title: Allow local mDNS server multicast request to remote mDNS clients
# Description:
#    Drop IPv4 mDNS multicast traffic to 224.0.0.251:5353

ip daddr 224.0.0.251 udp dport 5353 counter drop comment "local-to-remote mDNS/UDP/5353 multicast request"
